              Scene: {sceneError}
            </p>
          ) : null}
        </main>
        <aside
          aria-label="Memory rail"
          className="flex min-h-[20rem] flex-col gap-2 xl:col-start-2 xl:row-span-2 xl:row-start-1 xl:min-h-0"
